## Phase 3: Direct RFCOMM Channel (Channel 5)

### [MODIFY] [BtBRQueue.java](file://<private-windows-artifacts>/2025-12/miband9-imu-android/gadgetbridge/app/src/main/java/nodomain/freeyourgadget/gadgetbridge/service/btbr/BtBRQueue.java)
- Add `private int mPort = -1` and support for it in constructor.
- In [connect()](file://<private-windows-artifacts>/2025-12/miband9-imu-android/gadgetbridge/app/src/main/java/nodomain/freeyourgadget/gadgetbridge/service/devices/xiaomi/XiaomiBleSupport.java#199-203), if `mPort > 0`, use reflection to call `btDevice.createRfcommSocket(mPort)`.

### [MODIFY] [XiaomiSppSupport.java](file://<private-windows-artifacts>/2025-12/miband9-imu-android/gadgetbridge/app/src/main/java/nodomain/freeyourgadget/gadgetbridge/service/devices/xiaomi/XiaomiSppSupport.java)
- Update `commsSupport` instantiation to pass port `5` (or a dynamic port from coordinator).

