## Phase 5: Verification
1. Install updated APK.
2. Run [live_imu_forwarder.py](file://<private-agent-workspace>/live_imu_forwarder.py) on PC.
3. Click "Test New Function" on Phone.
4. Verify data scrolling on PC terminal.
